message: "If you use GeoTask in research, software, or technical reports, please cite this software."
title: "GeoTask: Explicit and Verifiable Spatiotemporal World Model for AI Agents"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Huang
    given-names: Qian
  - name: GeoTask Contributors
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-07-31
repository-code: "https://github.com/stpku/GeoTask"
url: "https://stpku.github.io/GeoTask/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - world models
  - embodied AI
  - spatiotemporal state
  - spatial reasoning
  - deterministic verification
  - geospatial
  - robotics
abstract: >-
  GeoTask is an open foundation for explicit and verifiable spatiotemporal
  world models for AI agents. It represents world objects, relations, state,
  evidence, constraints, and action eligibility through structured contracts
  and uses deterministic local operators to verify model-generated claims.
